From: bringup <bringup@local>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:11:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/38] kebab: Gate-2C-A2 USBFN driver binding runtime
 diagnostics

- Compile-time asserts pin the EFI_BOOT_SERVICES layout (Hdr=0x18):
  LocateProtocol=0x140, OpenProtocol=0x118, InstallMulti=0x148.
- [USBDEV] DriverBinding ownership resolved via
  DriverBinding->ImageHandle -> LoadedImage->FilePath -> FV file GUID
  matched against UsbfnDwc3Dxe 94F8A6A7-DC34-4101-88C1-99179CCEAE83.
- [USBDEV] USB Config (E722B03F) handles enumerated and inspected with
  OpenProtocolInformation() to detect BY_DRIVER opens by the USBFN agent.
- Second sample armed on ReadyToBoot (event, not timer).
- Read-only: no writes, no vendor patch, no protocol ownership taken.
